# L'Homme Luxe — Mandarine Tonka — Golden Chamber — DHP 2025 V1

## Authority and status

Inventory-independent target plus stock-corrected executable design hypothesis for a 30 mL EdP at 20% concentrate: 6,000 uL concentrate and 24,000 uL alcohol phase. Authority was frozen by the 2026-09-02 wave receipt and rechecked immediately before this batch. This file authorizes **no compounding, procurement, wear, safety, stability, release, or integration action**. Status: **NOT TESTED / HOLD**.

## Target identity

Defined before dosing: a pleasure-first L'Homme-family study whose identity is a pressurized, juicy red-mandarin peel opening cut by warm ginger, tailored by green-violet cloth, then opened into a hayed tonka chamber and a dry sandal/cedar echo. Hedonism is sought through contrast, tactile yielding, repeated warm/cool diagonals, and transitions—not sweetness or ingredient count.

Hard exclusions: no second citrus chorus; no cardamom-led LNDL drift; no cinnamon pastry; no vanilla dessert; no syrupy amber; no tonka blanket; no musk used to conceal weak transitions. If a future smell shows any of those defects, this candidate is rejected or reworked by a constant-total isolated arm.

## Functional architecture before dosing

|#|Target-native module|Primary owner|Relation / pleasure job|
|---:|---|---|---|
|1|Single red-mandarin peel pressure|Red Mandarin EO|Juicy brightness with pith and flesh, not cologne glare|
|2|Warm ginger cortex|Ginger EO + trace citral|Cuts peel and makes warmth arrive inside freshness|
|3|Green pith seam|Parmavert + Leafovert|Prevents jam and opens a dry perimeter|
|4|Violet tailored cloth|AIMI + ionone gradient|Dresses fruit and tonka; keeps the silhouette L'Homme-adjacent|
|5|Transparent breathing plane|Hedione + PEDMC + Freesia|Gives negative space between pressurized modules|
|6|Hayed tonka aperture|Tonka Absolute + coumarinic gradient|Natural dry entry into the chamber|
|7|Yielding golden chamber|Tonkarome + Coumarin + sandal pair|Warmth yields under pressure without pastry or vanilla ownership|
|8|Dry sandal pressure wall|Sandalore + Ebanol|Creamy and fresh faces create three-dimensional resistance; ideal Javanol remains unavailable and is not part of the current approximation|
|9|Cedar-vetiver echo|Virginia cedar + cedar + vetiver gradient|Returns peel dryness in the base|
|10|Musk-free recurrence matrix|Salicylate + benzoate + patchouli|Lengthens relations without a generic clean aura|

The ten modules, ten relations, and nineteen textural roles meet the predecessor floors. Row count conserves design states but is not claimed as smelled complexity.

